  "description": "A 2-mile run, 2 minutes rest, then 20 squat cleans at 135/95 lb, 20 box jumps, 20 overhead walking lunges with a 45/25 lb plate, 20 box jumps and 20 squat cleans, 2 minutes rest and another 2-mile run, in a vest if you have one. Honours U.S. Army 1st Lt. Daren M. Hidalgo, killed by an IED in Kandahar Province, Afghanistan, in 2011. Four miles of running; cut to 1-mile runs to scale.",
